                <pb facs="0541" n="471" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg471"/>

                <head>No. 257.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Frelinghuysen to Mr. Hoppin.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 30,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Frelinghuysen instructed Mr. Hoppin to ascertain and telegraph the regiment
                    in which O’Donnell had served, or the name of the captain of his company.</p>
            </div>
